WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.286 --> 00:00:12.137
Sign in as the business owner.

2
00:00:12.237 --> 00:00:18.372
Open Expenses. Every cost you have recorded is listed with its date, branch, category and amount.

3
00:00:20.273 --> 00:00:24.263
Search the list to find an expense by its number or payee.

4
00:00:24.363 --> 00:00:27.823
Click Add expense to record a new cost.

5
00:00:27.923 --> 00:00:31.805
The date is today by default. Enter the amount you paid.

6
00:00:31.905 --> 00:00:37.217
Choose a category so your reports can group the costs. Maintenance suits a repair.

7
00:00:37.317 --> 00:00:42.187
Pick the branch that bears the cost and how you paid. Cash is the default.

8
00:00:42.287 --> 00:00:47.213
Optional: say who you paid and add a note, so you remember what it was for.

9
00:00:47.313 --> 00:00:52.293
You can also attach a photo or PDF of the receipt at the bottom of the form.

10
00:00:52.393 --> 00:00:58.532
Leave Paid from the till on if the cash came out of the register drawer, then click Save expense.

11
00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:06.852
The expense is saved and appears in the list with its own number. Search for the payee to find it.

12
00:01:08.753 --> 00:01:14.284
Expenses also feed the Profit report. That is how you record what the business spends.
